*** Test Cases ***
5GC001416-ET-BA003-BA005_Verify_successful_SgNB_Addition_with_multi-frequency_band_cells_for_UE_use_alternative_band_with_CP-CL_solution
    [Documentation]    The purpose of this test case is to
    ...    1.Verify native band and alternave band will be send to enb in X2SetupResponse
    ...    2.Verify addition successfully when UE supported alternative band on gNB and the alternative band will be selected.
    ...    3.Verify addition successfully when UE supported both native band and alternative band on gNB,the native band will be selected.
    ...    4.Addition will reject when UE supported only alternative band on gNB,with wrong scs configuration
    ...    5.Addition will reject when UE supported native and alternative band on gNB,but wrong scs for both bands
    ...    6.Addition will reject when UE supported only native band on gNB with wrong scs configuration
    ...    7.Counters during the procedures
